# Local development settings for macOS
# Copy this file to .bazelrc.user to enable these settings.
#
# Prerendering calls the Algolia API, and the Bazel sandbox blocks network access
# by default. Allow network inside the sandbox instead of disabling sandboxing:
# a blanket --spawn_strategy=local lets tsc --project globs see undeclared files
# in external repos (e.g. rules_angular's orphaned worker sources) and fail.
build --sandbox_default_allow_network
